  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Tracks YNAB API v1.86.0. Breaking release — see MIGRATING.md in the repo. Budgets are now plans (GetBudgetsAsync is now GetPlansAsync, etc.) following the YNAB API rename, and the API surface is modernized: PascalCase record models with required/init members, DateOnly for dates, single methods with optional parameters, TransactionFilterType enum, namespace-level ApiException. Adds category/category group/payee creation, money movement endpoints, until_date filtering, formatted/currency amount fields, and recurring goal frequency.",
